13
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:05,810
You give the content type its options, such as Size and Color, once.

14
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:10,315
On each product, you enter the values of each option.

15
00:01:10,315 --> 00:01:13,880
The product gets one variant for each combination.

16
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:19,003
Shoppers pick a variant before adding to the cart, and the cart and

17
